@crew yilmaz-karin
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hello. Yilmaz, Survey. I carry samples carefully. And bake, when I'm allowed.
? tier>=acquaintance
- Hi, {me}. What's a sample's favourite meal? A slice. I'll go.   #funny
- Hello, {me}. Rest day soon. Brennan's given me an oven. One oven. A treaty.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- Hey, {me}. Saved you the corner piece. Corner pieces are for friends.   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- Good day. The bread rose, the joke landed, Nils groaned. Perfect.
? mood:low
- No joke today. I'm saving my strength.
== near
? act:breakfast
- Nils thinks his joke beat mine. Nils is wrong. Ask anyone. Ask nobody.   #funny
? act:work
- Careful. This box is older than both of us. Dr. Sato labelled it herself.
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I bake on rest days, if Brennan allows it. Brennan inspects the loaf like a Watch drill.   #funny
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- Bread on a rest day. The galley smells of it and everyone walks a bit slower past.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 3: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, bye, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue, hint, about, life)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Morning, {me}. Why was the sample so calm? It was well preserved.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- Oh, hi, {me}. It's been a while. I've got six jokes saved. Sit down.   #funny

== bye
- Bye! Mind your step. That's not a joke. The deck's wet.

== near
? habit:evening-shower
- Shower, then bed. Early bake tomorrow. Bread waits for no one.
? place:mess
- Is that my bread? It is. Brennan put it out. Don't tell me if it's good. Tell me.   #funny

== invite
- Tasting night? Brennan's letting me bring a loaf. Come and be honest. Kindly.

== accept
- Yes! Oh. Yes. I'll bring bread.
- Yes, please. I'll save you a crust. The good end.

== decline
- Not tonight. Early bed. Big bake tomorrow. Another time?
? weekday:wed|thu
- Rest day. Brennan's given me an oven. One oven. I'm not leaving it. Friday?   #funny

== missed
- You missed it. And the bread. The bread was very good. I'm sorry for you.   #funny

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday! I baked a small loaf. Your initial's on the crust.   #warm
? birthday:me
- My birthday. Nils told no joke at breakfast, as a present. Best breakfast ever.   #funny

== cue
? cue:event.ionStorm.onset
- Storm's in. I've taken my loaf out early. It'll be fine. It'll be fine.

== hint
- {me}. Have you a minute later? I'd like to say something. Not a joke.

== about
? aff:lemaire-nils:friend
- Nils thinks we're rivals. We are. He's also my favourite person at breakfast.   #warm

== life
? tier>=friend
- I was so quiet my first month. Then I told a joke at breakfast. Never looked back.   #funny
